---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Projects | Bimbola Coker">

  <section class="projects-section">
    <h1>My Projects</h1>

    <div class="projects-grid">

      <!-- Portfolio Website -->
      <article class="project-card">
        <img
          src="/Portfolio-Website.png"
          alt="Portfolio Website project"
          class="project-image"
        />

        <h2>Portfolio Website</h2>
        <p>
          Designed and developed a responsive personal portfolio website to
          showcase my education, skills, projects, and professional experience.
        </p>

        <h3>My Role</h3>
        <p>Designed, developed, tested, and deployed the website.</p>

        <h3>Tools & Skills</h3>
        <p>Astro, HTML, CSS, GitHub, Netlify, Responsive Design</p>

        <h3>Process</h3>
        <p>
          Planned the site structure, developed the pages, tested the layout,
          fixed issues, and deployed the final website.
        </p>

        <a
          href="https://bimbola-coker-pro.lovable.app"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="project-button"
        >
          View Live Portfolio
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- ENVEI -->
      <article class="project-card">
        <img
          src="/ENVEI.png"
          alt="ENVEI workforce measurement platform"
          class="project-image"
        />

        <h2>ENVEI</h2>
        <p>
          Co-founded ENVEI, a workforce measurement platform designed to help
          align education, skills, and labour market needs.
        </p>

        <h3>My Role</h3>
        <p>
          Co-founder involved in research, business development, product
          planning, communication, and project coordination.
        </p>

        <h3>Tools & Skills</h3>
        <p>
          Research, Business Analysis, Strategy, Communication,
          Project Management
        </p>

        <h3>Process</h3>
        <p>
          Researched the problem, identified workforce alignment challenges,
          developed the concept, worked with stakeholders, and contributed to
          product and business development.
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- IMD Showcase -->
      <article class="project-card">
        <img
          src="/IMD-Showcase.png"
          alt="IMD Summer 2026 Graduation Showcase campaign"
          class="project-image"
        />

        <h2>IMD Summer 2026 Graduation Showcase</h2>
        <p>
          Developed a digital campaign strategy to promote the Interactive
          Media Design Graduation Showcase.
        </p>

        <h3>My Role</h3>
        <p>
          Contributed to campaign research, LinkedIn content, content planning,
          social media strategy, and project coordination.
        </p>

        <h3>Tools & Skills</h3>
        <p>
          Social Media Strategy, Content Creation, Research, Figma,
          Project Management, Communication
        </p>

        <h3>Process</h3>
        <p>
          Researched the target audience, developed content ideas, planned
          social media activities, created campaign materials, and coordinated
          deliverables with the team.
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- Movie Review CMS -->
      <article class="project-card">
        <h2>Movie Review CMS</h2>

        <p>
          Developed a movie review content management system using a modern
          web development workflow.
        </p>

        <h3>My Role</h3>
        <p>
          Developed and deployed the project while working with the CMS,
          backend configuration, and web interface.
        </p>

        <h3>Tools & Skills</h3>
        <p>Strapi, JavaScript, HTML, CSS, GitHub, Render, CMS Development</p>

        <h3>Process</h3>
        <p>
          Built the application, configured the CMS, connected the required
          services, tested the system, solved deployment issues, and deployed
          the backend.
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- APOD Explorer -->
      <article class="project-card">
        <img
          src="/APOD-Explorer.png"
          alt="APOD Explorer application"
          class="project-image"
        />

        <h2>APOD Explorer</h2>

        <p>
          Created an interactive web application that allows users to explore
          NASA's Astronomy Picture of the Day.
        </p>

        <h3>My Role</h3>
        <p>
          Designed and developed the interface, connected the API, tested the
          application, and resolved image-path and functionality issues.
        </p>

        <h3>Tools & Skills</h3>
        <p>
          HTML, CSS, JavaScript, API Integration, GitHub, Responsive Design
        </p>

        <h3>Process</h3>
        <p>
          Planned the interface, built the application structure, connected
          the API, tested the results, identified problems, and refined the
          final experience.
        </p>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .projects-section {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 70px 30px;
  }

  .projects-section h1 {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
    color: #182443;
  }

  .projects-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .project-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 28px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .project-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 220px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    display: block;
  }

  .project-card h2 {
    color: #2864d7;
    font-size: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .project-card h3 {
    color: #182443;
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-top: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .project-card p {
    color: #222;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .project-button {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 25px;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    background: #182443;
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .project-button:hover {
    background: #2864d7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .projects-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .projects-section h1 {
      font-size: 38px;
    }
  }
</style>